  "releaseNotes": "Features:\n    - Adds ability to convert DOCX to PDF with WordDocument.ToPdf(). Requires IronPDF to work. WARNING: This is experimental functionality. It is expected to improve in the future.\n    - Adds ability to add basic styling to tables and table cells.\n    \n    Bug Fixes:\n    - Fixes ShapeContent points not updating when modifying ShapeContent.\n    - Fixes inherited styles from Word document objects not inheriting properly.\n    - Fixes ShapeContent and ImageContent not properly retrieving position information from Word documents.\n\n    Updates:\n    - Updates internal dependencies.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
